  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Spicy Pasta.png|left|200px|Spicy pasta]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 87\n |price = 1 to 576\n |time = 1 h 30 min\n |xp = 69\n |source = {{Infoicon|pastak|bigger|link=Pasta Kitchen}}\n |base = 160\n |dia = 5\n |time3 = 1 h 16 min\n}}\n'''Spicy pasta''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 87.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making spicy pasta'''===\n[[File:Pasta Kitchen.png|150px|left|Pasta kitchen]]\nSpicy pasta is made in the [[Pasta Kitchen]].\n\nTo make spicy pasta, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Fresh Pasta.png|75px|Fresh pasta|link=Fresh Pasta]]\n|[[File:Tomato Sauce.png|75px|Tomato sauce|link=Tomato Sauce]]\n|[[File:Chili Pepper.png|75px|Chili peppers|link=Chili Pepper]]\n|[[File:Onion.png|75px|Onions|link=Onion]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x2'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour and 30 minutes to make a plate of spicy pasta, and 1 hour and 16 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] kitchen. Each plate gives players 69 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling spicy pasta'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Spicy pasta can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 5,760 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 plates.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make spicy pasta costs 545 {{Infoicon|Coin}} coins.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for up to 1 spicy pasta per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Scharfe Nudeln\n|es = Pasta picante\n|fr = Pâtes Epicées\n|it = Arrabbiata\n|nl = Pittige Pasta\n|no = Krydret pasta\n|ru = Паста со специями\n|zh = Spicy Pasta\n}}\n[[pt-br:Massa apimentada]]\n\n[[Category:Pasta Kitchen Products]]\n[[Category:Chili Pepper Products]]\n[[Category:Onion Products]]\n[[Category:Fresh Pasta Products]]\n[[Category:Tomato Sauce Products]]",
